e":"0"}},"recommendations":{"total":115},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"9 Dec, 2025"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cAnxiety Puppy offers a short yet warm interactive journey that holds up a mirror to the anxiety of modern life. It is an emotional experience rather than a therapeutic tool that provides solutions. Approaching the game with the intention to relax and to understand your emotions will lead to a more rewarding experience.\u201d<br />\r\n\u9a6c\u91cc\u5965\u7237\u7237<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cCharming, emotional, and thoughtful \u2014 a unique narrative that turns anxiety into a companionable journey.\u201d<br />\r\nMassimo Solo<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cThis is more than just a game. If you are anxious, insecure, not confident, strongly recommend to play this game by reading through dialogues with the comforting background music. - It just heals you, no matter what.\u201d<br />\r\n\u5ba1\u8ba1\u5b66\u5bb6<br />\r\n","screenshots":[{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/fb389e75f458999005f36803417c52a8763abfc8/ss_fb389e75f458999005f36803417c52a8763abfc8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772760897","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/fb389e75f458999005f36803417c52a8763abfc8/ss_fb389e75f458999005f36803417c52a8763abfc8.600x338.jpg?t=1772760897"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/e77b70adb8762c6707487c7a0f3f48f0cdb7a003/ss_e77b70adb8762c6707487c7a0f3f48f0cdb7a003.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772760897","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/e77b70adb8762c6707487c7a0f3f48f0cdb7a003/ss_e77b70adb8762c6707487c7a0f3f48f0cdb7a003.600x338.jpg?t=1772760897"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/db80629ca12280b084f003565fdf4e647d1d935b/ss_db80629ca12280b084f003565fdf4e647d1d935b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772760897","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/db80629ca12280b084f003565fdf4e647d1d935b/ss_db80629ca12280b084f003565fdf4e647d1d935b.600x338.jpg?t=1772760897"},{"id":9,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/a294e7b249e32741753ebaf270285d659d96547e/ss_a294e7b249e32741753ebaf270285d659d96547e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772760897","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/a294e7b249e32741753ebaf270285d659d96547e/ss_a294e7b249e32741753ebaf270285d659d96547e.600x338.jpg?t=1772760897"},{"id":10,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/5df0d67d9772df6b313766b4b0c2e193a32503e6/ss_5df0d67d9772df6b313766b4b0c2e193a32503e6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772760897","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/5df0d67d9772df6b313766b4b0c2e193a32503e6/ss_5df0d67d9772df6b313766b4b0c2e193a32503e6.600x338.jpg?t=1772760897"},{"id":11,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/b325a22ba17eaf79fb70433e477545d3e67c66de/ss_b325a22ba17eaf79fb70433e477545d3e67c66de.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772760897","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/b325a22ba17eaf79fb70433e477545d3e67c66de/ss_b325a22ba17eaf79fb70433e477545d3e67c66de.600x338.jpg?t=1772760897"},{"id":12,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/d561e1fd11aa6b82029d9182866ee188f15c9911/ss_d561e1fd11aa6b82029d9182866ee188f15c9911.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772760897","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/d561e1fd11aa6b82029d9182866ee188f15c9911/ss_d561e1fd11aa6b82029d9182866ee188f15c9911.600x338.jpg?t=1772760897"},{"id":13,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/ca97086d206e6caef0c0990c735fda53e8980682/ss_ca97086d206e6caef0c0990c735fda53e8980682.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772760897","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/ca97086d206e6caef0c0990c735fda53e8980682/ss_ca97086d206e6caef0c0990c735fda53e8980682.600x338.jpg?t=1772760897"}],"short_description":"Anxiety Puppy is a 2D interactive narrative game that focuses on anxiety. In the game, anxiety is personified as a little puppy. Players will explore its story and try to coexist with it. Go find its traces and give it a hug.","steam_appid":3350190,"support_info":{"email":"puppystudio666@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"Simplified Chinese, English","type":"game","website":null}